1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
THAT WHINE UNDER THE CAR?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
NOT JUST NOISE.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
A FUEL PUMP HUMS STEADY.

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
LOUDER OR HIGHER PITCH? THAT'S WEAR.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,500
RUNNING LOW ON GAS MAKES IT WORSE.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,000
THE PUMP CAN OVERHEAT WITHOUT FUEL.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
IGNORE IT LONG ENOUGH...

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
...AND IT CAN FAIL WITHOUT WARNING.

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,000
ONE WHINE ISN'T A DIAGNOSIS.

10
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
STOP BY BEFORE IT STRANDS YOU.
